@startuml
title Showcase Control Panel - 기술 시연 제어 패널

class ShowcaseControlPanel {
  +BindFeatureToggleManager()
  +BindComparisonViewSystem()
  +SelectModule(string id)
  +Refresh()
}

class FeatureToggleView {
  +ShowModuleList()
  +ToggleModule(string id)
}

class ModuleSettingView {
  +ShowSettings(string moduleId)
  +ApplySetting(string key, object value)
}

class ComparisonViewPanel {
  +SetViewMode(ViewMode mode)
  +BindBeforeAfterTargets()
}

class MetricsView {
  +ShowMetrics()
  +ShowDiff()
}

class SkillEditorPanel
class SkillRuntimePanel
class SkillValidationPanel
class SkillEventTimeline

ShowcaseControlPanel --> FeatureToggleView : 모듈 토글 UI
ShowcaseControlPanel --> ModuleSettingView : 모듈 설정 UI
ShowcaseControlPanel --> ComparisonViewPanel : Before/After 뷰
ShowcaseControlPanel --> MetricsView : 성능 지표 UI
ShowcaseControlPanel --> SkillEditorPanel : 스킬 편집
ShowcaseControlPanel --> SkillRuntimePanel : 스킬 실행
ShowcaseControlPanel --> SkillValidationPanel : 데이터 검증
ShowcaseControlPanel --> SkillEventTimeline : 실행 흐름 표시

@enduml
